    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Output\n",
        "The first 5 passenger records are displayed.\n",
        "\n",
        "### My Observation\n",
        "I can immediately see the column names such as `PassengerId`, `Survived`, `Pclass`, `Name`, `Sex`, `Age`, and `Fare`. I can also see `NaN` values in places such as `Cabin`.\n",
        "\n",
        "### What I Learned\n",
        "`head()` is a quick way to inspect raw data before writing more analysis code.\n"
      ]
    },
