    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Output\n",
        "The final 5 rows are displayed.\n",
        "\n",
        "### My Observation\n",
        "The last record has index `890`, while its `PassengerId` is `891`.\n",
        "\n",
        "### What I Learned\n",
        "Pandas uses zero-based row positions, so row index and a dataset's ID column are not necessarily the same thing.\n"
      ]
    },
