      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Output\n",
        "The Age values for all passengers are displayed, including `NaN` where Age is missing.\n",
        "\n",
        "### My Observation\n",
        "Only one variable is returned instead of the whole DataFrame.\n",
        "\n",
        "### What I Learned\n",
        "A single-column selection is useful before calculations such as:\n",
        "\n",
        "```python\n",
        "df[\"Age\"].mean()\n",
        "```\n"
      ]
    },
