        "# 10. `iloc` — Select Rows by Position Index\n",
        "\n",
        "### Objective\n",
        "Access a row using its integer position(index).\n",
        "\n",
        "### Concept\n",
        "`iloc` means integer-location based indexing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 13,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [
        {
          "data": {
