      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Output\n",
        "The first passenger's complete record is returned.\n",
        "\n",
        "### My Observation\n",
        "`df.iloc[0]` gives the first row because Pandas uses zero-based indexing.\n",
        "\n",
        "### What I Learned\n",
        "`iloc[]` is useful when I know the row position rather than a column condition.\n"
      ]
